        "content": "## SETUP\n\nEnv vars required:\n\nLATE_REPLY_TABLE_ID\nCHATWOOT_URL\nCHATWOOT_API_TOKEN\n\nEVOLUTION_URL\nEVOLUTION_API_KEY\nEVOLUTION_INSTANCE\nEVOLUTION_GROUP_JID\n\nPolicy:\n5 min no reply\n→ WhatsApp group warning\n\n5 more min no reply\n→ assign to next ONLINE inbox agent\n\nNew agent gets same 5 + 5 minute cycle.\n\nAgent replies\n→ monitoring stops."
